# Scenario: the in-game menu's Developer pages (M11.0b, docs/M11_PLAN.md section 3.6), through the menu's own test
# input (DOTHEROES_OVERLAY_TEST: overlay.input) with every picture it composes dumped (DOTHEROES_OVERLAY_DUMP, the
# run directory): Developer on the main page; Warp; the D_1 group; D_1_1_1's arrival points; its default chosen --
# the menu closes and the game arrives there (the map's number 37). Then Status read on the held game, and Back out;
# then Player, Money, 9999 (M11.0c): the game's own money set from the menu; then Story, Flags and Quests viewed and
# Items, its first row the Boomerang (4), Give one (M11.0d): given through the game's own item-get.
# Starts from: the kept checkpoint castle-front.
#! saves build/checkpoints/castle-front
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_OVERLAY_TEST=1 DOTHEROES_OVERLAY_DUMP=.
#! env DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_CANT_DIE=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 600

include common.drive

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0 60
sleep 5
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait a wait wait wait wait wait down wait a wait wait a wait wait a
devstate area==37 120
sleep 5
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait down down down down down down down down down down down down wait a wait wait wait wait b wait b wait b wait b
sleep 5
devstate held==0,frames>+30 30
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait down wait a wait wait wait wait down down wait a wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait wait b wait b wait b wait b
devstate money==9999,held==0 60
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait down down wait a wait wait wait b wait down wait a wait wait wait b wait down wait a wait wait wait b wait down wait a wait wait wait a wait wait a wait wait wait b wait b wait b wait b
devstate held==0,frames>+30 60
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait down down down down down down wait a wait wait wait b wait b wait b
devstate held==0,frames>+30 60
write overlay.input open wait wait wait down down down down down wait a wait wait down down down down down down down down down wait a wait wait wait b wait down wait a wait wait wait b wait b wait b
devstate held==0,frames>+30 60
dev items
